---

Attribution: this project's mobile bridge implements the client half of the
backend protocol defined by Nous Research's Hermes Agent
(https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent, MIT). No upstream code is
vendored here; the renderer is consumed from upstream at build time (see
.github/workflows/android.yml). Bot Mode, profiles, sessions, and the
`X-Hermes-Session-Token` / `/api/ws?token=` auth model are upstream designs.
